<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="vi"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Aura Café | Tổng quan vận hành</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Material+Symbols+Outlined" rel="stylesheet"><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="${ctx}/assets/css/admin-schedule.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>.report-page{max-width:1280px;color:#292524}.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e7e5e4;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px #1c191708}.head{padding:20px}.db{padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f5f5f4;color:#78716c;font:700 10px monospace}.head h1{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin:6px 0 3px}.head p{font-size:12px;color:#78716c}.filter{height:36px;border:1px solid #e7e5e4;border-radius:12px;background:#fafaf9;font-size:12px;padding:0 12px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #f5f5f4}.stat{padding:12px;background:#fafaf9;border:1px solid #e7e5e4;border-radius:12px}.stat.primary{background:#fff7f7;border-color:#fecdd3;color:#a51225}.stat.success{background:#ecfdf5;border-color:#a7f3d0;color:#047857}.stat span{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.7}.stat strong{display:block;font:900 20px monospace}.stat small{font-size:10px}.box{padding:20px}.box h2{font-size:14px;font-weight:800}.chart{height:190px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7e5e4;display:flex;align-items:end;gap:14px;padding:0 12px 8px}.bar-wrap{height:100%;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:end;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:#78716c;font:10px monospace}.bar{width:100%;max-width:56px;background:#c85b68;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0}.bar.active{background:#a51225}.type-card,.status-row,.task{padding:10px 12px;background:#fafaf9;border-radius:10px}.type-card small{display:block;color:#a8a29e;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.progress{height:6px;background:#f5f5f4}.progress-bar{background:#a51225}.rank{width:21px;height:21px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;background:#a51225;color:#fff;font-size:10px}.task{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border:0;width:100%;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:left}.task.danger{background:#fff1f2;color:#9f1239}.task.warn{background:#fffbeb;color:#92400e}@media(max-width:900px){.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}</style></head>
<body class="admin-body"><jsp:include page="/components/admin-sidebar.jsp"><jsp:param name="activeMenu" value="reports"/></jsp:include><main class="admin-main-wrapper report-page">
<section class="panel head mb-4"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-3"><div><span class="db">Bảng: orders, order_items, payments</span><h1>Tổng quan vận hành</h1><p>Số liệu tính trực tiếp từ dữ liệu đơn hàng, thanh toán và kho.</p></div><select class="filter"><option>Toàn bộ thời gian</option><option>Ngày 24/10/2026</option><option>Ngày 23/10/2026</option></select></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat primary"><span>Doanh thu (đơn hoàn thành)</span><strong>14.850.000đ</strong></div><div class="stat"><span>Số đơn</span><strong>284</strong><small>268 hoàn thành • 4 hủy</small></div><div class="stat"><span>Giá trị TB / đơn</span><strong>52.300đ</strong></div><div class="stat success"><span>Đang xử lý</span><strong>12</strong></div></div></section>
<div class="row g-4 mb-4"><div class="col-xl-8"><section class="panel box h-100"><h2>Doanh thu theo ngày</h2><div class="chart"><div class="bar-wrap"><span>8.200k</span><div class="bar" style="height:55%"></div><span>20/10</span></div><div class="bar-wrap"><span>10.500k</span><div class="bar" style="height:70%"></div><span>21/10</span></div><div class="bar-wrap"><span>9.300k</span><div class="bar" style="height:62%"></div><span>22/10</span></div><div class="bar-wrap"><span>12.400k</span><div class="bar" style="height:83%"></div><span>23/10</span></div><div class="bar-wrap"><span>14.850k</span><div class="bar active" style="height:100%"></div><span>24/10</span></div></div><div class="row g-3 mt-2"><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="type-card"><small>Tại bàn</small><strong class="font-monospace">7.850.000đ</strong><span class="d-block text-muted">132 đơn</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="type-card"><small>Mang đi</small><strong class="font-monospace">3.200.000đ</strong><span class="d-block text-muted">63 đơn</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="type-card"><small>Online</small><strong class="font-monospace">3.800.000đ</strong><span class="d-block text-muted">89 đơn</span></div></div></div></section></div>
<div class="col-xl-4"><section class="panel box h-100"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-bottom pb-2 mb-3"><h2>Top món bán chạy</h2><a href="${ctx}/admin/products" class="text-danger fw-bold text-decoration-none">Sản phẩm →</a></div><div class="mb-3"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span><i class="rank">1</i> <strong>Cà phê Muối Aura</strong></span><span class="font-monospace">92 phần</span></div><div class="progress mt-1"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:100%"></div></div></div><div class="mb-3"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span><i class="rank">2</i> <strong>Trà Sen Vàng</strong></span><span class="font-monospace">65 phần</span></div><div class="progress mt-1"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:71%"></div></div></div><div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span><i class="rank">3</i> <strong>Bạc Xỉu</strong></span><span class="font-monospace">48 phần</span></div><div class="progress mt-1"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:52%"></div></div></div></section></div></div>
<div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-4"><section class="panel box h-100"><h2>Thanh toán thành công theo phương thức</h2><div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-3"><span>Tiền mặt</span><strong class="font-monospace">5.200.000đ</strong></div><div class="progress mt-1"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width:35%"></div></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-3"><span>Chuyển khoản</span><strong class="font-monospace">9.650.000đ</strong></div><div class="progress mt-1"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width:65%"></div></div></section></div><div class="col-lg-4"><section class="panel box h-100"><h2>Đơn theo trạng thái</h2><div class="status-row d-flex justify-content-between mt-3"><span>Chờ xác nhận</span><strong>3</strong></div><div class="status-row d-flex justify-content-between mt-2"><span>Đang pha chế</span><strong>5</strong></div><div class="status-row d-flex justify-content-between mt-2"><span>Đang giao</span><strong>4</strong></div><div class="status-row d-flex justify-content-between mt-2"><span>Hoàn thành</span><strong>268</strong></div></section></div><div class="col-lg-4"><section class="panel box h-100"><h2>Cần xử lý</h2><button class="task danger mt-3"><span>Nguyên liệu dưới mức tối thiểu</span><strong>4</strong></button><button class="task"><span>Đề xuất nhập hàng chờ duyệt</span><strong>2</strong></button><button class="task warn"><span>Đánh giá / khiếu nại chờ xử lý</span><strong>6</strong></button></section></div></div>
</main></body></html>
